{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1786833811, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "linux"}}
[0.100325, "o", "\u001b[1A\u001b[1B\u001b[0G\u001b[?25l[+] Creating 1/0\r\n \u001b[32m✔\u001b[0m Container aluminadb-mysql  \u001b[32mRunning\u001b[0m                                      \u001b[34m0.0s \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25h"]
[1.323097, "o", "============================================================\r\n"]
[1.325888, "o", "  ALUMINADB -- MONTHLY REPORT\r\n"]
[1.32959, "o", "============================================================\r\n"]
[3.336558, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.33802, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[3.339427, "o", " September 2019, day by day\r\n"]
[3.340756, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[3.342161, "o", "extrusion_pordia_v rolls input/output/yield up per day --\r\n"]
[3.344143, "o", "no report to build, just ask it for the month:\r\n"]
[5.348676, "o", "--------------\r\nSELECT\r\n    fecha,\r\n    ROUND(e__kg) AS input_kg,\r\n    ROUND(s__kg) AS output_kg,\r\n    ROUND(100 * ef, 1) AS yield_pct\r\nFROM extrusion_pordia_v\r\nWHERE fecha BETWEEN '2019-09-01' AND '2019-09-30'\r\n    AND e__kg IS NOT NULL\r\nORDER BY fecha\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n"]
[5.362271, "o", "+------------+----------+-----------+-----------+\r\n| fecha      | input_kg | output_kg | yield_pct |\r\n+------------+----------+-----------+-----------+\r\n| 2019-09-02 |      310 |       275 |      88.8 |\r\n| 2019-09-03 |      654 |       565 |      86.4 |\r\n| 2019-09-04 |      662 |       571 |      86.3 |\r\n| 2019-09-05 |      428 |       304 |      71.1 |\r\n| 2019-09-06 |      562 |       397 |      70.6 |\r\n| 2019-09-09 |      569 |       480 |      84.4 |\r\n| 2019-09-10 |       91 |        78 |      85.2 |\r\n| 2019-09-11 |      634 |       535 |      84.4 |\r\n| 2019-09-12 |     1561 |      1338 |      85.7 |\r\n| 2019-09-13 |     1549 |      1313 |      84.8 |\r\n| 2019-09-17 |     1053 |       881 |      83.7 |\r\n| 2019-09-18 |     1151 |       938 |      81.5 |\r\n| 2019-09-19 |      314 |       257 |      81.9 |\r\n| 2019-09-23 |      935 |       744 |      79.6 |\r\n| 2019-09-24 |      879 |       665 |      75.6 |\r\n| 2019-09-25 |     1104 |       926 |      83.9 |\r\n| 2019-09-26 |      299 |       218 |      72.8 |\r\n| 2019-09-30 |      848 |       674 |      79.4 |\r\n+------------+----------+-----------+-----------+\r\n18 rows in set\r\n\r\n"]
[8.366682, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.36806, "o", "Yield swings day to day (low-70s to mid-80s) -- normal run\r\n"]
[8.369428, "o", "to run variance, not a trend on its own.\r\n"]
[11.373424, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.375047, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[11.376423, "o", " Manual check -- do the daily numbers really add up to the month?\r\n"]
[11.377674, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[11.37898, "o", "Summing the daily rows by hand should land on exactly what a\r\n"]
[11.380219, "o", "dedicated monthly view reports -- no separate logic, same data:\r\n"]
[13.383086, "o", "--------------\r\nSELECT\r\n    ROUND(SUM(e__kg)) AS input_kg,\r\n    ROUND(SUM(s__kg)) AS output_kg,\r\n    ROUND(100 * SUM(s__kg) / SUM(e__kg), 1) AS yield_pct\r\nFROM extrusion_pordia_v\r\nWHERE fecha BETWEEN '2019-09-01' AND '2019-09-30'\r\n    AND e__kg IS NOT NULL\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n"]
[13.39466, "o", "+----------+-----------+-----------+\r\n| input_kg | output_kg | yield_pct |\r\n+----------+-----------+-----------+\r\n|    13603 |     11160 |        82 |\r\n+----------+-----------+-----------+\r\n1 row in set\r\n\r\n"]
[16.39846, "o", "\r\n"]
[16.400101, "o", "13603 kg in, 11160 kg out, 82% yield -- matches\r\n"]
[16.405608, "o", "extrusion_pormesano_v's own September row exactly, below.\r\n"]
[19.406103, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.407263, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[19.408568, "o", " Every month on record, aggregated\r\n"]
[19.409936, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[19.411268, "o", "extrusion_pormesano_v does the same rollup by month instead\r\n"]
[19.412407, "o", "of by day -- the whole production history in one query:\r\n"]
[21.415396, "o", "--------------\r\nSELECT\r\n    `year(fecha)` AS yr,\r\n    `month(fecha)` AS mo,\r\n    ROUND(se) AS input_kg,\r\n    ROUND(ss) AS output_kg,\r\n    ROUND(100 * ef, 1) AS yield_pct\r\nFROM extrusion_pormesano_v\r\nORDER BY yr, mo\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n"]
[21.433262, "o", "+------+------+----------+-----------+-----------+\r\n| yr   | mo   | input_kg | output_kg | yield_pct |\r\n+------+------+----------+-----------+-----------+\r\n| 2019 |    2 |     2356 |      2113 |      89.7 |\r\n| 2019 |    3 |     3350 |      3225 |      96.3 |\r\n| 2019 |    4 |     4648 |      3981 |      85.7 |\r\n| 2019 |    5 |     4843 |      4072 |      84.1 |\r\n| 2019 |    6 |     6482 |      5534 |      85.4 |\r\n| 2019 |    7 |    12898 |     10557 |      81.9 |\r\n| 2019 |    8 |     6289 |      5195 |      82.6 |\r\n| 2019 |    9 |    13603 |     11160 |        82 |\r\n| 2019 |   10 |    15616 |     12848 |      82.3 |\r\n| 2019 |   11 |     7306 |      5942 |      81.3 |\r\n| 2019 |   12 |    10101 |      7197 |      71.3 |\r\n| 2020 |    1 |    13831 |     10489 |      75.8 |\r\n| 2020 |    2 |    12064 |      8931 |        74 |\r\n| 2020 |    3 |     2143 |      1675 |      78.2 |\r\n| 2020 |    4 |     2259 |      1748 |      77.3 |\r\n| 2020 |    5 |     5699 |      4570 |      80.2 |\r\n| 2020 |    6 |     4586 |      3587 |      78.2 |\r\n+------+------+----------+-----------+-----------+\r\n17 rows in set\r\n\r\n"]
[24.437644, "o", "\r\n"]
[24.438935, "o", "December 2019 is the confirmed low point at 71.3% -- worth a\r\n"]
[24.440501, "o", "look at what changed that month, visible at a glance, month\r\n"]
[24.442124, "o", "over month, with no manual rollup.\r\n"]
[27.447074, "o", "Bye\r\n"]
